[["hello","interj","/həˈləʊ/","你好","what you say when you meet someone","hallo","Hello! I'm Anna.","你好！我是安娜。"],["hi","interj","/haɪ/","嗨；你好（随意）","a friendly, informal hello","hi; hallo","Hi, Tom! How are you?","嗨，汤姆！你好吗？"],["good morning","phr","","早上好","hello in the morning","guten Morgen","Good morning, Mr Patel!","早上好，帕特尔先生！"],["good afternoon","phr","","下午好","hello in the afternoon","guten Tag (nachmittags)","Good afternoon. Can I help you?","下午好。需要帮忙吗？"],["good evening","phr","","晚上好","hello in the evening","guten Abend","Good evening, everyone.","大家晚上好。"],["good night","phr","","晚安","what you say before you go to bed","gute Nacht","Good night, Mum. Sleep well.","晚安，妈妈。睡个好觉。"],["goodbye","interj","/ˌɡʊdˈbaɪ/","再见","what you say when you leave","auf Wiedersehen","Goodbye! Have a nice day.","再见！祝你今天愉快。"],["bye","interj","/baɪ/","拜拜（随意）","an informal goodbye","tschüss","Bye! See you on Monday.","拜拜！周一见。"],["see you later","phr","","回头见","goodbye, I will see you again soon","bis später","I have to go now. See you later!","我得走了。回头见！"],["see you tomorrow","phr","","明天见","goodbye, I will see you tomorrow","bis morgen","Thanks for today. See you tomorrow!","谢谢你今天的帮忙。明天见！"],["how are you?","phr","","你好吗？","a friendly question about how someone feels","Wie geht es dir?","Hi, Sara! How are you?","嗨，萨拉！你好吗？"],["I'm fine, thanks.","phr","","我很好，谢谢。","a short answer to 'How are you?'","Mir geht's gut, danke.","I'm fine, thanks. And you?","我很好，谢谢。你呢？"],["And you?","phr","","你呢？","you ask the same question back","Und dir?","I'm from Berlin. And you?","我是柏林人。你呢？"],["not bad","phr","","还不错","quite good, OK","nicht schlecht","\"How are you?\" \"Not bad, thanks.\"","“你好吗？”“还不错，谢谢。”"],["nice to meet you","phr","","很高兴认识你。","what you say when you meet someone for the first time","Freut mich.","I'm Leo. Nice to meet you.","我是利奥。很高兴认识你。"],["What's your name?","phr","","你叫什么名字？","a question to learn someone's name","Wie heißt du?","Hi! What's your name?","嗨！你叫什么名字？"],["My name is …","phr","","我叫……","you tell someone your name","Ich heiße …","My name is Mia.","我叫米娅。"],["Where are you from?","phr","","你是哪里人？","a question about someone's country or city","Woher kommst du?","Where are you from, Anna?","安娜，你是哪里人？"],["I'm from …","phr","","我来自……","you say your country or city","Ich komme aus …","I'm from China. I live in Hamburg.","我来自中国。我住在汉堡。"],["please","adv","/pliːz/","请","a polite word when you ask for something","bitte","A coffee, please.","请给我一杯咖啡。"],["thank you","phr","","谢谢你","what you say when someone helps you","danke","Thank you for the flowers!","谢谢你的花！"],["thanks","interj","/θæŋks/","谢谢（随意）","an informal thank you","danke","Thanks! That's very kind.","谢谢！你真好。"],["You're welcome.","phr","","不客气。","a polite answer to 'thank you'","Gern geschehen.","\"Thank you!\" \"You're welcome.\"","“谢谢！”“不客气。”"],["sorry","adj","/ˈsɒri/","对不起","what you say when you make a mistake","Entschuldigung; tut mir leid","Sorry, I'm late!","对不起，我迟到了！"],["excuse me","phr","","打扰一下；劳驾","a polite way to start a question","Entschuldigung","Excuse me, where is the station?","打扰一下，车站在哪里？"],["no problem","phr","","没问题","it's OK, don't worry","kein Problem","\"Sorry!\" \"No problem.\"","“对不起！”“没问题。”"],["yes","adv","/jes/","是；对","the answer when something is true or you agree","ja","Yes, I'd like some tea.","是的，我想喝点茶。"],["no","adv","/nəʊ/","不；不是","the answer when something is not true or you don't agree","nein","No, thank you. I'm full.","不用了，谢谢。我吃饱了。"],["of course","phr","","当然","yes, certainly","natürlich","\"Can I sit here?\" \"Of course!\"","“我可以坐这里吗？”“当然！”"],["I don't understand.","phr","","我不明白。","you say this when something is not clear to you","Ich verstehe das nicht.","Sorry, I don't understand.","对不起，我不明白。"],["Can you say that again, please?","phr","","请你再说一遍好吗？","a polite way to ask someone to repeat","Kannst du das bitte wiederholen?","Can you say that again, please? More slowly?","请你再说一遍好吗？慢一点？"],["slowly","adv","/ˈsləʊli/","慢慢地","not fast","langsam","Please speak slowly.","请说慢一点。"],["What does … mean?","phr","","……是什么意思？","you ask about a word you don't know","Was bedeutet …?","What does \"cosy\" mean?","“cosy”是什么意思？"],["How do you say … in English?","phr","","……用英语怎么说？","you ask for a word in English","Wie sagt man … auf Englisch?","How do you say \"Brot\" in English?","“Brot”用英语怎么说？"],["what","pron","/wɒt/","什么","a question word for things","was","What is your phone number?","你的电话号码是多少？"],["who","pron","/huː/","谁","a question word for people","wer","Who is that man?","那个男人是谁？"],["where","adv","/weə/","哪里","a question word for places","wo","Where do you live?","你住在哪里？"],["when","adv","/wen/","什么时候","a question word for time","wann","When is your birthday?","你的生日是什么时候？"],["why","adv","/waɪ/","为什么","a question word for reasons","warum","Why are you sad?","你为什么难过？"],["how","adv","/haʊ/","怎么；怎样","a question word for the way or the state","wie","How do you go to work?","你怎么去上班？"],["which","pron","/wɪtʃ/","哪一个","a question word when you choose","welche(r, s)","Which bus goes to the centre?","哪一路公交车去市中心？"],["how much","phr","","多少（钱）；多少（不可数）","a question about price or amount","wie viel","How much is this bag?","这个包多少钱？"],["how many","phr","","多少（可数）","a question about a number of things","wie viele","How many brothers do you have?","你有几个兄弟？"],["how old","phr","","多大（年纪）","a question about age","wie alt","How old are you?","你多大了？"],["whose","pron","/huːz/","谁的","a question word for who something belongs to","wessen","Whose phone is this?","这是谁的手机？"],["Where is …?","phr","","……在哪里？","you ask for a place","Wo ist …?","Where is the toilet, please?","请问洗手间在哪里？"],["left","noun","/left/","左边","the side of your body where your heart is","links","The bank is on the left.","银行在左边。"],["right","noun","/raɪt/","右边","the opposite of left","rechts","Turn right at the café.","在咖啡馆那儿右转。"],["turn left","phr","","向左转","go to the left","links abbiegen","Turn left at the traffic lights.","在红绿灯处左转。"],["turn right","phr","","向右转","go to the right","rechts abbiegen","Turn right into Park Road.","右转进入公园路。"],["go straight on","phr","","一直往前走","walk without turning","geradeaus gehen","Go straight on for two minutes.","一直往前走两分钟。"],["near","prep","/nɪə/","在……附近","not far from","in der Nähe von","Is there a supermarket near here?","这附近有超市吗？"],["far","adj","/fɑː/","远","a long way away","weit","Is it far from here?","离这儿远吗？"],["next to","prep","","在……旁边","very close to, at the side of","neben","The bakery is next to the bank.","面包店在银行旁边。"],["opposite","prep","/ˈɒpəzɪt/","在……对面","on the other side of","gegenüber","The station is opposite the park.","车站在公园对面。"],["corner","noun","/ˈkɔːnə/","拐角","the place where two streets meet","die Ecke","There's a café on the corner.","拐角处有一家咖啡馆。"],["street","noun","/striːt/","街道","a road in a town with houses or shops","die Straße","I live on a quiet street.","我住在一条安静的街上。"],["station","noun","/ˈsteɪʃn/","车站","a place where trains or buses stop","der Bahnhof","The station is ten minutes away.","车站在十分钟路程外。"],["bus stop","noun","","公交车站","a place where the bus stops","die Bushaltestelle","Wait for me at the bus stop.","在公交车站等我。"],["traffic lights","noun","","红绿灯","red, yellow and green lights for cars","die Ampel","Stop at the traffic lights.","在红绿灯前停下。"],["What time is it?","phr","","现在几点？","a question about the time","Wie spät ist es?","Excuse me, what time is it?","打扰一下，现在几点？"],["o'clock","adv","/əˈklɒk/","……点钟","used for full hours","Uhr","It's three o'clock.","现在三点。"],["half past","phr","","……点半","30 minutes after the hour","halb (+ nächste Stunde)","It's half past seven.","现在七点半。"],["quarter past","phr","","……点一刻","15 minutes after the hour","Viertel nach","The film starts at quarter past eight.","电影八点一刻开始。"],["quarter to","phr","","差一刻……点","15 minutes before the hour","Viertel vor","It's quarter to nine.","现在差一刻九点。"],["morning","noun","/ˈmɔːnɪŋ/","早上；上午","the time from early day to 12 o'clock","der Morgen; der Vormittag","I drink coffee every morning.","我每天早上喝咖啡。"],["afternoon","noun","/ˌɑːftəˈnuːn/","下午","the time from 12 o'clock to about 6 o'clock","der Nachmittag","We have English in the afternoon.","我们下午上英语课。"],["evening","noun","/ˈiːvnɪŋ/","晚上","the time from about 6 o'clock until night","der Abend","What are you doing this evening?","你今晚做什么？"],["night","noun","/naɪt/","夜里","the dark time when people sleep","die Nacht","I sleep eight hours every night.","我每晚睡八个小时。"],["today","adv","/təˈdeɪ/","今天","this day","heute","Today is Monday.","今天是星期一。"],["tomorrow","adv","/təˈmɒrəʊ/","明天","the day after today","morgen","See you tomorrow!","明天见！"],["yesterday","adv","/ˈjestədeɪ/","昨天","the day before today","gestern","Yesterday was very cold.","昨天很冷。"],["now","adv","/naʊ/","现在","at this moment","jetzt","I'm at home now.","我现在在家。"],["later","adv","/ˈleɪtə/","晚些时候","after now","später","I'll call you later.","我晚点给你打电话。"],["minute","noun","/ˈmɪnɪt/","分钟","60 seconds","die Minute","Wait a minute, please.","请稍等一分钟。"],["hour","noun","/ˈaʊə/","小时","60 minutes","die Stunde","The train takes one hour.","火车要一个小时。"],["week","noun","/wiːk/","星期；周","seven days","die Woche","I work five days a week.","我一周工作五天。"],["month","noun","/mʌnθ/","月","about 30 days","der Monat","My course is three months long.","我的课程为期三个月。"],["year","noun","/jɪə/","年","12 months","das Jahr","I'm thirty years old.","我三十岁。"],["Monday","noun","/ˈmʌndeɪ/","星期一","the day after Sunday","Montag","I start work on Monday.","我星期一开始上班。"],["Tuesday","noun","/ˈtjuːzdeɪ/","星期二","the day after Monday","Dienstag","My English class is on Tuesday.","我的英语课在星期二。"],["Wednesday","noun","/ˈwenzdeɪ/","星期三","the day after Tuesday","Mittwoch","On Wednesday I go swimming.","星期三我去游泳。"],["Thursday","noun","/ˈθɜːzdeɪ/","星期四","the day after Wednesday","Donnerstag","The shop is closed on Thursday.","商店星期四关门。"],["Friday","noun","/ˈfraɪdeɪ/","星期五","the day after Thursday","Freitag","Let's meet on Friday evening.","我们星期五晚上见吧。"],["Saturday","noun","/ˈsætədeɪ/","星期六","the day after Friday","Samstag","On Saturday I sleep late.","星期六我睡懒觉。"],["Sunday","noun","/ˈsʌndeɪ/","星期日","the day after Saturday","Sonntag","We visit my parents on Sunday.","我们星期天去看我父母。"],["January","noun","/ˈdʒænjuəri/","一月","the first month of the year","Januar","It snows a lot in January.","一月雪很多。"],["February","noun","/ˈfebruəri/","二月","the second month","Februar","February is a short month.","二月是个短月份。"],["March","noun","/mɑːtʃ/","三月","the third month","März","Spring starts in March.","春天从三月开始。"],["April","noun","/ˈeɪprəl/","四月","the fourth month","April","My birthday is in April.","我的生日在四月。"],["May","noun","/meɪ/","五月","the fifth month","Mai","The flowers are beautiful in May.","五月的花很美。"],["June","noun","/dʒuːn/","六月","the sixth month","Juni","We go on holiday in June.","我们六月去度假。"],["July","noun","/dʒuˈlaɪ/","七月","the seventh month","Juli","July is often very hot.","七月常常很热。"],["August","noun","/ˈɔːɡəst/","八月","the eighth month","August","School starts again in August.","学校八月重新开学。"],["September","noun","/sepˈtembə/","九月","the ninth month","September","I moved here in September.","我九月搬到这里。"],["October","noun","/ɒkˈtəʊbə/","十月","the tenth month","Oktober","The leaves are red in October.","十月树叶红了。"],["November","noun","/nəʊˈvembə/","十一月","the eleventh month","November","November is grey and rainy.","十一月灰蒙蒙的，常下雨。"],["December","noun","/dɪˈsembə/","十二月","the last month of the year","Dezember","We bake cookies in December.","我们十二月烤饼干。"],["zero","num","/ˈzɪərəʊ/","零","0","null","My number starts with zero.","我的号码以零开头。"],["one","num","/wʌn/","一","1","eins","I have one sister.","我有一个姐姐。"],["two","num","/tuː/","二","2","zwei","Two coffees, please.","请来两杯咖啡。"],["three","num","/θriː/","三","3","drei","We have three cats.","我们有三只猫。"],["four","num","/fɔː/","四","4","vier","The class starts at four.","课四点开始。"],["five","num","/faɪv/","五","5","fünf","I walk five minutes to work.","我走五分钟去上班。"],["six","num","/sɪks/","六","6","sechs","I get up at six.","我六点起床。"],["seven","num","/ˈsevn/","七","7","sieben","A week has seven days.","一周有七天。"],["eight","num","/eɪt/","八","8","acht","The shop opens at eight.","商店八点开门。"],["nine","num","/naɪn/","九","9","neun","My son is nine.","我儿子九岁。"],["ten","num","/ten/","十","10","zehn","It costs ten euros.","它要十欧元。"],["eleven","num","/ɪˈlevn/","十一","11","elf","I go to bed at eleven.","我十一点睡觉。"],["twelve","num","/twelv/","十二","12","zwölf","A year has twelve months.","一年有十二个月。"],["thirteen","num","/ˌθɜːˈtiːn/","十三","13","dreizehn","She is thirteen years old.","她十三岁。"],["fourteen","num","/ˌfɔːˈtiːn/","十四","14","vierzehn","The bus comes in fourteen minutes.","公交车十四分钟后到。"],["fifteen","num","/ˌfɪfˈtiːn/","十五","15","fünfzehn","Fifteen students are in my class.","我们班有十五个学生。"],["sixteen","num","/ˌsɪksˈtiːn/","十六","16","sechzehn","I live at number sixteen.","我住在十六号。"],["seventeen","num","/ˌsevnˈtiːn/","十七","17","siebzehn","The museum is on bus seventeen.","坐十七路车可以到博物馆。"],["eighteen","num","/ˌeɪˈtiːn/","十八","18","achtzehn","He is eighteen today!","他今天十八岁了！"],["nineteen","num","/ˌnaɪnˈtiːn/","十九","19","neunzehn","The tickets are nineteen pounds.","票价十九英镑。"],["twenty","num","/ˈtwenti/","二十","20","zwanzig","It's twenty degrees today.","今天二十度。"],["thirty","num","/ˈθɜːti/","三十","30","dreißig","The film is thirty minutes long.","这部片子三十分钟长。"],["forty","num","/ˈfɔːti/","四十","40","vierzig","My mum is forty.","我妈妈四十岁。"],["fifty","num","/ˈfɪfti/","五十","50","fünfzig","I have fifty euros.","我有五十欧元。"],["sixty","num","/ˈsɪksti/","六十","60","sechzig","An hour has sixty minutes.","一小时有六十分钟。"],["seventy","num","/ˈsevnti/","七十","70","siebzig","My grandfather is seventy.","我爷爷七十岁。"],["eighty","num","/ˈeɪti/","八十","80","achtzig","The book has eighty pages.","这本书有八十页。"],["ninety","num","/ˈnaɪnti/","九十","90","neunzig","The train takes ninety minutes.","火车要九十分钟。"],["a hundred","num","","一百","100","hundert","There are a hundred people here.","这里有一百个人。"],["a thousand","num","","一千","1,000","tausend","The bike costs a thousand euros.","这辆自行车一千欧元。"],["first","num","/fɜːst/","第一","number 1 in order","erste(r, s)","This is my first English class.","这是我的第一堂英语课。"],["second","num","/ˈsekənd/","第二","number 2 in order","zweite(r, s)","I live on the second floor.","我住在二楼（英式：三楼）。"],["third","num","/θɜːd/","第三","number 3 in order","dritte(r, s)","Take the third street on the left.","走左边第三条街。"],["weather","noun","/ˈweðə/","天气","rain, sun, wind and so on","das Wetter","What's the weather like today?","今天天气怎么样？"],["sunny","adj","/ˈsʌni/","晴朗的","with a lot of sun","sonnig","It's sunny and warm today.","今天晴朗暖和。"],["rainy","adj","/ˈreɪni/","下雨的","with a lot of rain","regnerisch","It's a rainy day in London.","伦敦今天下雨。"],["cloudy","adj","/ˈklaʊdi/","多云的","with a lot of clouds","bewölkt","It's cloudy but not cold.","多云，但不冷。"],["windy","adj","/ˈwɪndi/","有风的","with a lot of wind","windig","It's very windy by the sea.","海边风很大。"],["cold","adj","/kəʊld/","冷的","not warm","kalt","It's cold. Take a jacket.","天冷，带件外套。"],["hot","adj","/hɒt/","热的","very warm","heiß","It's hot in summer.","夏天很热。"],["warm","adj","/wɔːm/","温暖的","a little hot, nice","warm","The water is warm today.","今天水很暖。"],["It's raining.","phr","","在下雨。","rain is falling now","Es regnet.","Take an umbrella. It's raining.","带把伞，在下雨。"],["It's snowing.","phr","","在下雪。","snow is falling now","Es schneit.","Look! It's snowing!","看！下雪了！"],["happy","adj","/ˈhæpi/","开心的","feeling good","glücklich; froh","I'm happy to see you.","见到你我很开心。"],["sad","adj","/sæd/","难过的","not happy","traurig","Why are you sad?","你为什么难过？"],["tired","adj","/ˈtaɪəd/","累的","you need to rest or sleep","müde","I'm tired after work.","下班后我很累。"],["hungry","adj","/ˈhʌŋɡri/","饿的","you want to eat","hungrig","I'm hungry. Let's eat!","我饿了。我们吃饭吧！"],["thirsty","adj","/ˈθɜːsti/","渴的","you want to drink","durstig","I'm thirsty. Is there any water?","我渴了。有水吗？"],["bored","adj","/bɔːd/","无聊的","not interested, nothing to do","gelangweilt","I'm bored. Let's go out.","我好无聊。我们出去吧。"],["angry","adj","/ˈæŋɡri/","生气的","feeling very unhappy with someone","wütend","My boss is angry today.","我老板今天很生气。"],["excited","adj","/ɪkˈsaɪtɪd/","兴奋的","very happy about something that will happen","aufgeregt (vor Freude)","I'm excited about the trip!","我对这次旅行很兴奋！"],["nervous","adj","/ˈnɜːvəs/","紧张的","a little afraid","nervös","I'm nervous before the test.","考试前我很紧张。"],["ill","adj","/ɪl/","生病的","not healthy","krank","I'm ill today. I'm staying at home.","我今天病了，待在家里。"],["busy","adj","/ˈbɪzi/","忙的","with a lot to do","beschäftigt","Sorry, I'm busy now.","对不起，我现在很忙。"],["relaxed","adj","/rɪˈlækst/","放松的","calm, not worried","entspannt","I feel relaxed on holiday.","度假时我觉得很放松。"],["knock on","phr","/nɒk ɒn/","敲（门）","to hit a door with your hand to ask to come in","an die Tür klopfen","Someone knocked on the door.","有人敲了门。"],["jump on","phr","","跳到……上","to go up into the air and land on something","auf etwas springen","Biscuit jumped on my legs.","饼干跳到了我的腿上。"],["shake","v","/ʃeɪk/","甩；抖动","to move quickly up and down or side to side","schütteln","Biscuit shook water all over the newspaper.","饼干把水甩得报纸上到处都是。"],["all over","phr","","到处；遍及","in every part of a place or thing","überall","He shook water all over a man's newspaper.","它把水甩得一位男士的报纸上到处都是。"],["harbour","noun","/ˈhɑːbə/","港口","a place by the sea where boats stay","der Hafen","I met Sam at the harbour.","我在港口和萨姆见面。"],["seagull","noun","/ˈsiːɡʌl/","海鸥","a white sea bird that is often near the coast","die Möwe","A seagull took his sandwich.","一只海鸥抢走了他的三明治。"],["nearly","adv","/ˈnɪəli/","差点；几乎","almost, but not completely","beinahe","I nearly fell off the bench.","我差点从长椅上掉下来。"],["while","conj","/waɪl/","当……的时候；一边……一边","during the time that something else is happening","während","I was making dinner while you were talking.","你说话的时候我正在做晚饭。"],["everywhere","adv","/ˈevriweə/","到处；每个地方","in every place","überall","I was looking for you everywhere.","我到处找你。"],["popcorn","noun","/ˈpɒpkɔːn/","爆米花","a snack of corn that pops when it is heated, eaten at the cinema","Popcorn","I bought a huge box of popcorn.","我买了一大盒爆米花。"],["How about …?","phr","","……怎么样？不如……？","a way to suggest an idea","wie wäre es mit …?","How about dinner instead?","不如改成吃晚饭？"],["Don't worry.","phr","","别担心。","you say this to help someone feel calm","Keine Sorge.","Don't worry. This time I'm going to write it down.","别担心。这次我会把它写下来。"],["bamboo","noun","/bæmˈbuː/","竹子","a tall plant with hard, hollow stems","Bambus","Musicians hit bamboo sticks to make rhythms.","乐手敲击竹棒来制造节奏。"],["oil drum","noun","/ˈɔɪl drʌm/","油桶","a large metal container for oil","Ölfass","A modern steelpan is made from an oil drum.","现代钢鼓是用油桶做成的。"],["oval","noun","/ˈəʊvl/","椭圆","a shape like a long circle, or an egg","Oval","Each oval on the drum is one note.","鼓面上每个椭圆是一个音。"],["contest","noun","/ˈkɒntest/","比赛","a competition where people try to win","Wettbewerb","Panorama is a big steelband contest.","Panorama 是一场大型钢鼓乐队比赛。"],["grow out of","phr","","由……发展而来","to start from something earlier","hervorgehen aus","The steelpan grew out of the bamboo bands.","钢鼓是从竹乐队发展而来的。"]]